  English overrides live in values-en/cash_path_result_strings.xml.

  Copy rules: states are rendered exactly as the model reports them. Unknown facts
  render as unknown, never as zeros; no FX, no fabricated headlines, no live-balance
  promises, and no invented scope or freshness claims. Numbers lead; the tone stays
  dry and executive. No emoji, no exclamation points.
-->
